    "detailed_description": "Potions &amp; Emotions is an indie visual novel created by a small team of student developers. Accompany Thalia--an aspiring alchemist and wannabe super villain--who is hell-bent on taking over the entire planet. She travels to a magical forest in order to collect raw materials for her alchemy projects, and stumbles upon a sleepy town hidden within. After seeing this and recognizing the potency of the magic surrounding this town, she decides to start small and set up her secret lair within its walls by taking over as the town\u2019s next mayor.",
    "about_the_game": "Potions &amp; Emotions is an indie visual novel created by a small team of student developers. Accompany Thalia--an aspiring alchemist and wannabe super villain--who is hell-bent on taking over the entire planet. She travels to a magical forest in order to collect raw materials for her alchemy projects, and stumbles upon a sleepy town hidden within. After seeing this and recognizing the potency of the magic surrounding this town, she decides to start small and set up her secret lair within its walls by taking over as the town\u2019s next mayor.",
    "short_description": "Potions and Emotions is a creative game where you play the conscience of the villain. Join Thalia\u2014a fae with big ambitions\u2014who intends to take over a town hidden in a magical forest. Whether her shoulder angel or devil, you get to guide her actions and witness the consequences of your choices.",
